[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13382.229, "timestamp": "03:43:02", "text": "不同的猫。哦，我选了一个大的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13384.469, "timestamp": "03:43:04", "text": "朋友。等等，你的生日。快乐的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13386.95, "timestamp": "03:43:06", "text": "生日。 Zuzuki是那个女孩。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13389.269, "timestamp": "03:43:09", "text": "金发女郎。呃，不。今天是我的周年纪念日"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13395.51, "timestamp": "03:43:15", "text": "很快。就这样。哦，不。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13397.83, "timestamp": "03:43:17", "text": "好的。哦，是的。你只能通过以下方式吃肉："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13399.349, "timestamp": "03:43:19", "text": "就是这样，Jocknick。我忘了提"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13403.189, "timestamp": "03:43:23", "text": "那。哦，等等。选择沃尔弗雷。不是W。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13404.95, "timestamp": "03:43:24", "text": "等待。是的，是沃福德。是的。我要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13408.309, "timestamp": "03:43:28", "text": "没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13410.55, "timestamp": "03:43:30", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13416.229, "timestamp": "03:43:36", "text": "帮任何人取东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13419.269, "timestamp": "03:43:39", "text": "我忘了这里没有声音。我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13422.87, "timestamp": "03:43:42", "text": "在户外挑选词语。这是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13424.469, "timestamp": "03:43:44", "text": "是的。我感觉自己快要疯掉了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13427.429, "timestamp": "03:43:47", "text": "最后一次，一如既往。哦，那是条狗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13429.03, "timestamp": "03:43:49", "text": "它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13431.03, "timestamp": "03:43:51", "text": "在一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13435.67, "timestamp": "03:43:55", "text": "好的。所以，他们都选择了那个方案。所以，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13439.269, "timestamp": "03:43:59", "text": "滞后。是的，有点卡顿。是的，就是这样。"}]